✈️ Airline Ticket Analysis
This project explores an airline ticket dataset to understand price patterns, key features, and factors influencing ticket costs. 

📊 Main Steps
Data preprocessing & handling missing values
Exploratory data analysis
Visualization of pricing trends
Feature selection and correlation insights
Simple ML models for price prediction

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Matplotlib · Seaborn · Scikit-learn · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Airline Tickets.ipynb — full analysis and plots
